sc ;c4 3/4 in.  aperformed musicbprm2rdacontent  aaudiobs2rdamedia  aaudio discbsd2rdacarrier  adigital2rdatr  boptical2rdarm  c1.4 m/s  aaudio file2rdaft  bCD audio11bsoprano voicen1aorchestrae1r1t12lcmpt1 aBiographies in music  aOpera excerpts  aSung in French, German, Italian and Russian0 aRegina Resnik, soprano; with various soloists ; unidentified orchestras and conductors  aRecorded live, 1944-1961  a"Fiftieth anniversary tribute"--Container  aBiographical notes by Charles Handelman ([8] p. : ports.) inserted in container0 aL'enfant prodigue. Air de Lia / Debussy -- La reine de Saba. Plus grand dans son obscurité / Gounod -- Ernani. Ernani, involami / Verdi -- Cavalleria rusticana. Voi lo sapete / Mascagni -- Andrea Chénier. La mamma morta / Giordano -- Zazà. Ebbene, sì, so tutto / Leoncavallo -- Die Walküre. Hinweg! Hinweg! Flieh die Entwei[h]te / Wagner (with Ramon Vinay) -- Boris Godunov. Recitative & aria of Marina / Mussorgsky -- Don Carlo. Trema per te, falso figliol[o]! / Verdi (with Eugenio Fernandi, Ettore Bastianini) -- Le Cid. Pleurez, mes yeux / Massenet -- La favorite. O mon Fernand / Donizetti -- The maid of Orleans. Adieu forêt[s] / Tchaikovsky (sung in Russian) -- Le prophète. Ah, mon fils / Meyerbeer -- Aida. Ohimè! morir mi sento / Verdi (with Walter Kreppel) -- Die Walküre. So ist es denn aus mit den ewigen Göttern / Wagner 0aOperasvExcerpts.0http://id.loc.gov/authorities/subjects/sh85094931 0aSongs (High voice) with orchestra.0http://id.loc.gov/authorities/subjects/sh85125146 6aOpérasvExtraits.0(CaQQLa)201-0014136 6aChansons (Voix aiguë) acc. d'orchestre.0(CaQQLa)201-0062541 7aOperasxExcerpts.2fast0(OCoLC)fst010462030http://id.worldcat.org/fast/1046203 7aSongs (High voice) with orchestra.2fast0(OCoLC)fst011261500http://id.worldcat.org/fast/1126150 7aExcerpts.2aat0(CStmoGRI)aatgf300026939 7aArt music.2fast0(OCoLC)fst019200070http://id.worldcat.org