 3 (1:30) / André Jolivet -- Music for children : op. 65. Waltz / Serge Prokofiev (1:27) -- Children's corner. Dr. Gradus ad Parnassum (2:13) ; The little shepherd (2:03) ; Le petit nègre = The little black boy (2:02) / Claude Debussy -- Ten easy pieces. An evening in the country (2:46) ; For children : book 1. Andante (1:44) ; Swineherd's song (2:02) ; Moderato (:43) ; Jest (1:00) / Béla Bartók -- Three pieces. Danse noble = Noble danse (:58) ; Chant des moissons = Song of the harvests (6:40) ; Nostalgie du pays = Homesickness (1:18) / Miłosz Magin -- Miniature variations / Janez Matičič (1:32)0 aHard copy version record 0aPiano music.0http://id.loc.gov/authorities/subjects/sh85101782 0aVariations (Piano)0http://id.loc.gov/authorities/subjects/sh85142205 0aPiano music, Arranged.0http://id.loc.gov/authorities/subjects/sh85101791 0aWaltzes.0http://id.loc.gov/authorities/subjects/sh85144994 6aPiano, Musique de.0(CaQQLa)201-0008260 6aVariations (Piano)0(CaQQLa)201-0018611 6aPiano, Musique de, arr.0(CaQQLa)201-0014161 6aValses.0(CaQQLa)201-00132731 aRév, Lívia,d1916-2018,einstrumentalist.0http://id.loc.gov/authorities/names/n871169261https://id.oclc.org/worldcat/entity/E39PBJcrcJYbjbhyJD3Ch3cpT31 aGarban, Lucien,earranger of music.0http://id.loc.gov/authorities/names/n880375321https://id.oclc.org/worldcat/entity/E39PBJwdgv4XD3Mhwh9wQGrXh31 aCortot, Alfred,d1877-1962,earranger of music.0http://id.loc.gov/authorities/names/n791002191https://id.oclc.org/worldcat/entity/E39PBJh4tMgGw6BPCghkDdcVmd12iContainer of (work):aBach, Johann Sebastian,d1685-1750.tKleine Präludien,nBWV 933-938,nBWV 937.0http://id.loc.gov/authorities/names/n0007489912iContainer of (work):aBach, Johann Sebastian,d1685-1750.tKleine Präludien,nBWV 924-932,nBWV 930.0http://id.loc.gov/authorities/names/no200713363912iContainer of (work):aDaquin, Louis-Claude,d1694-1772.tPièces de clavecin.pCoucou.0http://id.loc.gov/authorities/name