12040821https://id.oclc.org/worldcat/entity/E39PBJkT7GyCmyjxytDfqk6Yfq 7aGraphic novels.2lcgft0http://id.loc.gov/authorities/genreForms/gf2014026362 7aGraphic novels.2fast0http://id.worldcat.org/fast/1726630 7aTranslations.2fast0http://id.worldcat.org/fast/1423791 7aFiction.2lcgft0http://id.loc.gov/authorities/genreForms/gf20140263391 aOda, Eiichirō,d1975-eauthor,eartist.0http://id.loc.gov/authorities/names/nb20070092591 aCaselman, Lance,eadaptor.0http://id.loc.gov/authorities/names/no20030718781 aNakatani, Andy,etranslator.0http://id.loc.gov/authorities/names/nb2007009262  aZ0bSTF  hNO HOLDINGS IN STF - 14 OTHER HOLDINGSffi13fccd9b-d0d3-44a9-ad21-a9930886d69cs018834b9-0003-4df7-bf3d-3f663f795ff409975nam a2201621ui in0000030394520250403134924.0a||||go|||||||||||cr mn|---uuuuu200421s2012||||xx ||||go|||||||| u|eng|d  als30303  aNYHLSbengerdacNYHLSdCstdUtOrBLW00aDraw it with Your Eyes Closed: The Art of the Art Assignment 1a[Place of publication not identified] :bPaper Monument,c2012  a1 online resource  atextbtxt2rdacontent  acomputerbc2rdamedia  aonline resourcebcr2rdacarrier0 aPaper Monument ;v2  aArchived and cataloged by Library Stack  aSubscriber Lendable  a"Draw It with Your Eyes Closed: the Art of the Art Assignment is a unique and wide-ranging anthology featuring essays, drawings, and assignments from over one hundred contributors including John Baldessari, William Pope.L, Mira Schor, Rochelle Feinstein, Bob Nickas, Chris Kraus, Liam Gillick, Amy Sillman, James Benning, and Michelle Grabner. Bringing together assignments, anti-assignments, and artworks from both teachers and students from a broad range of institutions, we hope it simultaneously serves as an archive and an instigation, a teaching tool and a question mark, a critique and a tribute."--cprovided by distributor  aStandard Copyright10aArchives.0http://id.loc.gov/authorities/subjects/sh8500691310aArtists' wr