roughout  aDom Cobb is the best there is at extraction; stealing valuable secrets inside the subconscious during the mind's vulnerable dream state. His skill has made him a coveted player in industrial espionage, but also has made him a fugitive and cost him dearly. Now he may get a second chance if he can do the impossible; inception, planting an idea rather than stealing one. If they succeed, Cobb and his team could pull off the perfect crime  aIncludes special features0 aDisc 1. Feature film -- Disc 2. Bonus features1 aEnglish subtitles for the deaf and hard-of-hearing (SDH). 0aBusiness intelligencevDrama. 0aDreamsvDrama.0http://id.loc.gov/authorities/subjects/sh2009123807 0aSubconsciousnessvDrama. 7aSueñosvTeatro.2bidex 7aSubconscienciavTeatro.2bidex 7aBusiness intelligence.2fast0(OCoLC)fst008427230http://id.worldcat.org/fast/842723 7aDreams.2fast0(OCoLC)fst011984900http://id.worldcat.org/fast/1198490 7aSubconsciousness.2fast0(OCoLC)fst011364060http://id.worldcat.org/fast/1136406 7aAction and adventure filmsxAudio-visual materials.2lcgft 7aAction and adventure films.2fast0(OCoLC)fst017105680http://id.worldcat.org/fast/1710568 7aDrama.2fast0(OCoLC)fst014238790http://id.worldcat.org/fast/1423879 7aFeature films.2fast0(OCoLC)fst017103840http://id.worldcat.org/fast/1710384 7aScience fiction films.2fast0(OCoLC)fst017104070http://id.worldcat.org/fast/1710407 7aVideo recordings for the hearing impaired.2fast0(OCoLC)fst017104500http://id.worldcat.org/fast/1710450 7aFeature films.2gsafd 7aScience fiction films.2gsafd 7aFeature films.2lcgft0http://id.loc.gov/authorities/genreForms/gf2011026247 7aAction and adventure films.2lcgft0http://id.loc.gov/authorities/genreForms/gf2011026005 7aScience fiction films.2lcgft0http://id.loc.gov/authorities/genreForms/gf2011026556 7aVideo recordings for the hearing impaired.2lcgft0http://id.loc.gov/authorities/genreForms/gf2011026725 7aFilms d'